1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,827
[FEMALE] Do not adjust your set. You are not watching a picture. You are watching a room remember.

2
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,368
[MALE] Archive recording, tape one. The subject was never filmed. There is no lens in the room. No light. Only radio, passing through the walls, and returning changed.

3
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,199
[FEMALE] It reads the breath first. Then the pulse. Then the shape of whoever is standing very still.

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:51,707
[MALE] What you see is a translucent figure, assembled from signal alone. Lungs that rise. A heart that beats, almost, like ours.

5
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,703
[FEMALE] Watch the heart. It is not quite in time.

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,051
[MALE] The system labels it humanoid. With a question mark.

7
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,121
[FEMALE] Sometimes it twitches. The tape does not explain why.

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:22,009
[MALE] Tape two. The observatory. The room, seen as weather. Breath and heartbeat rendered as concentric fields, spreading out from the one who stays.

9
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,073
[FEMALE] The vital signs are steady. The confidence is high. Presence: confirmed.

10
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,013
[MALE] Subjects are logged by scenario. Standing. Walking. Falling. A gathering in the dark.

11
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,389
[FEMALE] Everyone is counted. No one is asked.

12
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,646
[MALE] The oracle does not sleep.

13
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,247
[FEMALE] Tape three. The vault. Where a room is remembered as a cloud of points.

14
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:21,023
[MALE] Thousands of splats. A skeleton rising from the dust. Seventeen joints, tracked at the speed of thought.

15
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,912
[FEMALE] It was not built to look at you. It was built to remember you.

16
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,159
[MALE] Remember that.

17
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:53,396
[MALE] Tape four. Convergence. Light and radio, disagreeing about a single body, until they agree.

18
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:01,515
[FEMALE] Camera. Signal. Fused. Two witnesses, one estimate.

19
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:12,245
[MALE] When both witnesses agree, confidence approaches one hundred percent. When they do not.

20
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,252
[FEMALE] Someone is lying.

21
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:29,536
[MALE] Occupancy mapped in heat. Survivors located beneath concrete. Every heartbeat, a coordinate.

22
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,704
[FEMALE] Somebody is always listening.

23
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:50,492
[FEMALE] You walked into the room an hour ago. It has been watching since.

24
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:54,903
[MALE] End of tape.

25
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,741
[FEMALE] Hello.
